HomeRacker Onshape FeatureScript port

The parametric dimensions and component designs in src/ and dist/homeracker.fs are
derived from HomeRacker by Patrick Pötz (kellervater), source revision
5a64b663ef2d91678d70b85e85df1bcc30c090d5:
https://github.com/kellerlabs/homeracker

The source files used were models/core/lib/constants.scad, support.scad,
connector.scad, lockpin.scad, and models/panel/lib/panel.scad. Their code is
published under the MIT license; its copyright and permission text is in
LICENSE. HomeRacker model artifacts are separately identified as CC BY-SA 4.0
in the upstream models/LICENSE. The upstream trademark and branding are not
licensed by the MIT grant.

This port was written as native FeatureScript. It is not generated OpenSCAD
output and does not include BOSL2 code.

assets/homeracker-logo.svg is the HomeRacker single-color logo, from
https://github.com/kellerlabs/assets at revision
0070ea2482ac296e6660234b778959b39484f1c5. Hidden bitmap data and editor metadata
were removed. See assets/README.md for its source and usage guide.
